  "annaya-tour.walk-through-annaya-onli.stop-1-of-5": "第1站，共5站",
  "annaya-tour.the-monastery-on-the-mou.the-monastery-on-the-mountain": "山上的修道院",
  "annaya-tour.the-monastery-on-the-mou.begin-on-the-hillside-annaya-belongs-to-the-jbeil-district-r": "从山坡开始。安纳亚属于朱拜勒区，位于贝鲁特以北约52公里。修道院坐落于海拔约1,200米的林木覆盖山坡。晴天时，越过露台，可以望见远处下方的大海。",
  "annaya-tour.the-monastery-on-the-mou.why-it-matters": "为何重要：",
  "annaya-tour.the-monastery-on-the-mou.charbel-spent-most-of-his-grown-life-on-this-hill-and-every": "夏尔贝勒成年后的大部分岁月都在这座山上度过，接下来的每一站，距你所站之处都只需步行一小段。",
  "annaya-tour.the-monastery-on-the-mou.photo-paul-saad": "摄影：Paul Saad，",
