  "annaya-tour.the-monastery-on-the-mou.cc-by-sa-4-0-cropped-and-resized": ", CC BY-SA 4.0（已裁切并调整尺寸）",
  "annaya-tour.accessibility.night-view-from-above-of-the-annaya-church-with-its-lit-cros": "从高处俯瞰安纳亚教堂的夜景，发光的十字架和修道院建筑位于松林及村庄灯光之间",
  "annaya-tour.the-monastery-on-the-mou.stop-2-of-5": "第2站，共5站",
  "annaya-tour.the-church-built-for-the.the-church-built-for-the-pilgrims": "为朝圣者而建的教堂",
  "annaya-tour.the-church-built-for-the.once-charbel-was-beatified-in-1965-visitors-came-in-far-grea": "夏尔贝勒于1965年宣福后，访客人数大增，旧建筑已无法容纳。黎巴嫩马龙尼修会因此建起更大的新教堂，于1974年祝圣。陵墓本身则位于附近的拱顶陵墓教堂，这是本次漫步的第4站。",
  "annaya-tour.the-church-built-for-the.why-it-matters": "为何重要：",
  "annaya-tour.the-church-built-for-the.its-size-tells-you-how-many-people-still-make-the-climb-espe": "教堂的规模告诉你，至今仍有多少人攀上山来，尤其在每月22日及7月庆日期间。",
  "annaya-tour.the-church-built-for-the.photo-saintcharbel-com": "摄影：saintcharbel.com。",
  "annaya-tour.accessibility.the-stone-monastery-courtyard-at-annaya-at-night-with-arched": "夜晚安纳亚的石砌修道院庭院，有拱形窗户与圆形石喷泉",
  "annaya-tour.the-church-built-for-the.stop-3-of-5": "第3站，共5站",
  "annaya-tour.the-courtyard.the-courtyard": "庭院",
  "annaya-tour.the-courtyard.every-pilgrim-passes-through-this-courtyard-on-the-way-in-th": "每位朝圣者进入时都会经过这个庭院。墙壁是裸露的石材，窗户呈拱形，中央喷泉轻声流淌。入内无需付费，也不会被询问信仰。",
  "annaya-tour.the-courtyard.why-it-matters": "为何重要：",
  "annaya-tour.the-courtyard.people-arrive-talking-and-leave-quiet-the-place-works-on-you": "人们交谈着前来，安静地离开。在你决定祈祷之前，这个地方已开始触动你。",
  "annaya-tour.the-courtyard.photo-saintcharbel-com": "摄影：saintcharbel.com。",
  "annaya-tour.accessibility.arched-tomb-chamber-at-annaya-with-a-candle-lit-icon-of-sain": "安纳亚拱形墓室，圣髑龛上方有烛光照亮的圣夏尔贝勒圣像",
  "annaya-tour.the-courtyard.stop-4-of-5": "第4站，共5站",
  "annaya-tour.the-tomb.the-tomb": "陵墓",
  "annaya-tour.the-tomb.here-is-what-the-climb-is-for-a-line-forms-and-the-people-in": "这就是登山前来的目的。人们排起队，边等候边祈祷。许多人手握一张折好的纸，上面写着一个名字。轮到你时，无需作任何表演：跪下，愿意的话触摸墓石，停留到你需要的时刻。",
  "annaya-tour.the-tomb.why-it-matters": "为何重要：",
